l=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><mo>:</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><mo>\u2212</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>\u2264</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>\u2264</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><mo>\u2212</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>\u2212</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>\u2264</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>\u2264</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>\u2212</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">}</mo></mrow><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\nSo, this is a type II region.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, only statements I and II are true.</p>\n</div></div>",
